<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11742] Web console: grid-showing-rows component in grids with no selection</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11742</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;The issue:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Changes to grid-showing-rows component introduced by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9981&quot; title=&quot;Web Console: We need to update the counters on the tables.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9981&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9981&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; assume that all grid instances have selection module enabled. This is not true in some cases (see ui-grid/template.pug), which causes &quot;can&apos;t access property of undefined&quot; type of runtime errors.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;What to do:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Handle missing selection API on grid instances in grid-showing-rows.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
